==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From the idea that the calculation or reasoning would be jotted down on any available scrap of paper such as the actual [[back]] of an [[envelope]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-au-back-of-the-envelope.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

